<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%-FILE('/css/provincial_championship.css')%>">

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <h1>2026 FIRST Newfoundland and Labrador Provincial Championship</h1>
            <h3>DATE TBD</h3>
            <p>The Newfoundland and Labrador Provincial Championship is an annual celebration of STEM in the province. Students from all over the province participating in the FIRST LEGO League and FIRST Tech Challenge programs come together to compete for the title of "provincial champions".</p>
            <div>
                <a class="btn bg-dark-teal text-white">Event Guide</a>
                <a class="btn bg-dark-teal text-white">Event Schedule</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-fluid bg-championship-stats position-relative p-0">
    <div class="bg-overlay position-absolute top-0 left-0 w-100 h-100 z-1"></div>
    <div class="container text-white z-2 position-relative py-5">
        <h5 class="text-white text-center fw-bold">2025 Provincial Championship Attendees</h5>
        <div class="row text-center">
            <div class="col">
                <p class="fs-md-2 attendance-stat">500+</p>
                <p class="fs-5">Attendees</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <p class="attendance-stat">29</p>
                <p class="fs-5">Teams</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <p class="attendance-stat">220+</p>
                <p class="fs-5">Students</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <p class="attendance-stat">70+</p>
                <p class="fs-5">Volunteers</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-center">More than a robotics competition</h1>
    <p>The Provincial Championship is an opportunity for students in Newfoundland and Labrador to meet like minded peers, and discover the broader STEM community in the province. Students engage in hands-on learning under pressure while in a safe environment. Students build their critical skills such as project management, communication, engineering design, collaboration, and more. For many students, this is the first time they see themselves as leaders in science and technology, inspiring them to pursue future careers as leaders and innovators in Newfoundland and Labrador.</p>
</div>

<div class="container-fluid bg-first-canopy py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Public Viewing Available</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">The event is free and open for the public to spectate. See the amazing creations of students in the province and watch robots compete head to head. Check out the event schedule below.</p>
                        <a class="btn btn-link">Event Schedule</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Start a Team</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">Competing teams must consist of at least 2 youth members and at least 2 coaches. Learn more about starting a team and competing at the FIRST Robotics Newfoundland and Labrador Provincial Championships below.</p>
                        <a class="btn px-4 bg-fll-red text-white fw-bold" href="<%-LINK('/fll')%>">FLL</a>
                        <a class="btn px-4 bg-ftc-orange text-white fw-bold" href="<%-LINK('/ftc')%>">FTC</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">Volunteer Opportunities</h5>
                        <p class="card-text">There's a role for everyone to help inspire the next generation of innovators and leaders. Volunteers are a core part of FIRST Robotics Newfoundland and Labrador.</p>
                        <a class="btn btn-link">Volunteer with us</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="text-center fw-bold">2026 Team List</h1>
